zephyr-artinchip

Derived hardware descriptions and reset-hook register facts preserve notices
from ArtInChip Technology Co., Ltd (2022-2026) and Alibaba Group Holding Limited
(2017-2019), under Apache-2.0. Exact originals, revisions, per-file SHA-256 and
transformations are recorded in docs/provenance.yml. No whole SDK or RT-Thread
runtime is included. This is not a clean-room authorship claim.

The prerequisite patch modifies upstream Zephyr CLIC files retaining notices of
Tokita, Hiroshi (2021) and Andes Technology Corporation (2025). Its legacy-layout
facts refer to the Alibaba CSI header. Other Zephyr code remains an external,
pinned dependency with its own licenses/notices. The SDK GCC runtime remains an
external toolchain library; its linked members are identified in candidate.json.
Original project files use Apache-2.0. Human ownership, license compatibility,
DCO review and sign-off remain pending before external redistribution/upstreaming.
